          "html": "<p>\n  Data doesn't need <code>send</code> so far: <code>add</code>, <code>remove</code> and <code>set</code> cover it. No\n  built-in project uses <code>send</code>, so renaming events is cheap if you want it. I softened that line, and asked the\n  one real choice as <a href=\"#q14\">Q14</a>.\n</p>"
